'''Glass Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]]. He can be unlocked when clearing the stage [[N-1 Grand Prix (Deadly)|King Wahwah's Revenge]] appearing on the '''5th''', '''6th''', '''19th''' and '''20th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]] increases slow duration and grants the [[Knockback|knockback]] ability.

