==Trivia==
*Glass Cat is the second cat unit to have the Metal ability, the first being [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]].
*Glass Cat is the first unit who dies after attacking.
*Macho Crystal Cat's description is missing the apostrophe in "let's".
*Despite its evolved form stating its glass is slightly more durable, it does not gain HP upon evolution.

